  "rationale": "Setting --skip_trimming true stops TRIMGALORE and FQ_LINT_AFTER_TRIMMING (the latter is gated on !skip_trimming). The raw FastQC, CAT_FASTQ, FQ_LINT and all reference preparation keep the same inputs and are unaffected. Every step from BBSplit onward now receives untrimmed reads, so BBSplit, strandedness inference, STAR alignment and all downstream QC, quantification, bigWig and MultiQC tasks must be re-executed."
